== Bugs ==
{{bug|If Tooth and Nail is lost while in the statue form (e.g. through losing its {{i|Lemegeton}} wisp), Isaac will indefinitely remain in the statue form until he leaves the room.}}
{{bug|Using an active item with no cooldown repeatedly ({{i|Mom's Bracelet}}, {{i|Bag of Crafting}}, etc.) whilst in an invulnerable state will keep Isaac in that state.}}

